1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,067
Rule four. In a whiteout, walk from
marker to marker. If you can't see the
next one, stop.

2
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:10,733
You don't stop. She's out there. You
walk ten minutes. Twenty. Forty.

3
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:15,400
Footprints! Fresh ones! One person,
heading up! That's her!

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:20,333
You follow them. You're almost
running. Half an hour. Your chest is
on fire.

5
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:25,000
Then you notice something. Next to
every left boot, a small round hole.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,900
The hole a cane makes.

7
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:28,933
Those are mine.

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:35,933
You just walked a full circle. Without
a landmark, people really do.
Scientists tested it.
